{
  "id": "Lyo.Encryption.XChaCha20Poly1305",
  "name": "Lyo.Encryption.XChaCha20Poly1305",
  "area": "Security",
  "tagline": "XChaCha20-Poly1305 (24-byte nonce, 32-byte key) authenticated-encryption addon for `Lyo.Encryption`.",
  "description": "XChaCha20-Poly1305 (24-byte nonce, 32-byte key) authenticated-encryption addon for `Lyo.Encryption`. Uses an HChaCha20 subkey derivation step then BouncyCastle's IETF ChaCha20-Poly1305 implementation for the inner AEAD.\n\nInstall this addon only when you actually use XChaCha20-Poly1305 — the core `Lyo.Encryption` package no longer pulls BouncyCastle on `net10`.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Unkeyed",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "using Lyo.Encryption;\nusing Lyo.Encryption.Extensions;\nusing Lyo.Encryption.Symmetric.ChaCha.XChaCha20Poly1305;\nusing Lyo.Encryption.XChaCha20Poly1305;\nusing Lyo.KeyStore;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n\nservices.AddLocalKeyStore(ks => ks.UpdateKeyFromString(\"k\", \"secret\"));\nservices.AddXChaCha20Poly1305Encryption();\nservices.AddDefaultEncryptionService<XChaCha20Poly1305EncryptionService>();"
    },
    {
      "title": "Keyed two-key",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddKeyedLocalKeyStore(\"ks\", ks => ks.UpdateKeyFromString(\"k\", \"secret\"));\nservices.AddXChaCha20Poly1305EncryptionServiceKeyed(\"primary\", \"ks\");"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mixed DEK / KEK (core package)",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddKeyedLocalKeyStore(\"primary\", ks => { /* ... */ });\nservices.AddEncryptionServiceKeyed<XChaCha20Poly1305EncryptionService, AesGcmEncryptionService>(\"primary\", \"primary\");"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Dependency injection",
      "text": "Requires **`IKeyStore`**. Use `configure =>` on key-store registration to bind secrets from **`IConfiguration`** ([`Lyo.KeyStore`](../Lyo.KeyStore/README.md))."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Mixed DEK / KEK (core package)",
      "text": "See [`Lyo.Encryption`](../Lyo.Encryption/README.md) for RSA helpers and `AddDefaultTwoKeyEncryptionService<T>()`."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Performance",
      "text": "BenchmarkDotNet on Intel Core Ultra 7 155U (.NET 10.0.9, June 2026): **2.54 ms encrypt / 2.34 ms decrypt @ 1 MB** (~3.8× AES-GCM; HChaCha20 + BouncyCastle). Benchmarks use explicit key material. Full tables: [`BENCHMARK_SUMMARY.md`](../Lyo.Encryption.Benchmarks/BENCHMARK_SUMMARY.md)."
    }
  ],
  "links": [],
